# AI Orchestration Standards

## QuickIdeaAgent
- Maintain <2s response time for "unstick", "spark", "tweak", and "check" flows.
- Use deterministic prompts located in `pkg/prompts/`.
- Ensure context-awareness without leaking sensitive data.

## Ollama Integration
- Support local model hosting via Ollama.
- Implement robust retry logic and fallback to lighter models if needed.
- Use `internal/infra/ollama` for client communication.

## RAG & Knowledge Base
- Use ChromaDB for semantic search in the knowledge base.
- Follow the 6-stage pipeline architecture defined in `docs/tdd_markdown.md`.
- Ensure all AI-generated content is clearly marked as such.
